{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/951186-question-about-mage-sight","id":951186,"title":"Question about Mage sight","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-15T10:24:17-07:00","id":951186,"title":"Question about Mage sight","content":"if a mage were to activate the version from the life arcana where they could discern somethings age, sex, and species how would it work in a house of mirrors maze?<br /> <br /> Could the mage use it to tell the difference between a reflection and the real thing?<br /> <br /> <br /> Could a mage discern what a creature is through a reflection?\u200b<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T10:33:21-07:00","id":951190,"title":"","content":"Interesting question, I think you could identify things about it but not which reflection is the real one. You'd have to cast a Life Unveiling or Knowing for that. Others might disagree, but I'm basing my assumption on the fact that you can scrutinize live feeds and that's a sort of reflection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T23:09:17-07:00","id":952336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seta143</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/951186-question-about-mage-sight#post951186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could the mage use it to tell the difference between a reflection and the real thing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Matter sight could. It would tell you the structure and durability of the mirror.<br /> Forces sight could. It would tell you that light is bouncing there.<br /> Spaces sight could. It would tell you that the direct distance between you and the person is not the same as the visually apparent distance.<br /> <br /> The other sights don't really have an easy way of detecting that what you're looking at is a reflection.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> If your character knows they're in a maze of mirrors, you could potentially used Focused Mage sight though and consider it a fairly low obscurity mystery to pierce if you're determined to do it through magesight. Otherwise a simple knowing spell is probably better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6748,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","user":"Michael Kenner","date":". 08-17-2016, 02:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T12:00:11-07:00","id":952648,"title":"","content":"First, it has to be noted: The thing you're talking about is a spell, not Mage Sight. The Active version of Life Sight doesn't reveal the age, sex, etc., of a creature; merely whether it's alive and, if so, how alive it is (sickness, injury, etc.).<br /> <br /> With that in mind, my answer would be that a mirror would still allow the spell to function, but it wouldn't tell you it's a reflection; it'd just tell you the details about the creature you're looking at. Life Sight, meanwhile, would tell you that what you're looking at isn't alive and is merely a reflection.<br /> <br /> That's my take on it, at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}